%% Static publication architecture: no application server or cloud runtime.
flowchart LR
    author[Site owner\ncommits reviewed content]
    repo[GitHub repository\nmain branch + static files]
    pages[GitHub Pages\nstatic hosting configuration]
    browser[Visitor browser\nHTML · CSS · inline JS · SVG]
    assets[Local assets\nfonts · images · CV · metadata]

    author -->|review and merge| repo
    repo -->|Pages publishes root files| pages
    pages -->|HTTPS static response| browser
    assets -->|served as relative files| browser

    classDef source fill:#16212f,stroke:#38e2c8,color:#e6edf5;
    classDef host fill:#102d45,stroke:#5aa9ff,color:#e6edf5;
    classDef user fill:#1c2732,stroke:#a9b8c9,color:#e6edf5;
    class author,repo,assets source;
    class pages host;
    class browser user;
